# Optimization Annex: "If one or more charge counters would be put on an artifact you control, that many plus one charge
# counters are put on it instead" (CR 122.6, 614.1a) - on an artifact already on the battlefield too, not only one entering
# with counters. Bot1 stations its Queen's Diamond with a Memnite (power 1): station would put one charge counter on it
# (CR 702.184a), and the Annex makes it two.

